          SEG

          MOVE W I H'12345678', R0
          ROT I 4, R0, R1

          MOVE W I H'12345678', R2
          ROT I -4, R2, R3

          MOVE W I H'80000001', R4
          ROT I 1, R4, R5

          MOVE W I H'80000001', R6
          ROT I -1, R6, R7

          MOVE W I H'FFFFFFFF', R8
          ROT I 16, R8, R9

          MOVE W I 1, R10
          ROT I 31, R10, R11

          HALT
          END
